{"seq":2,"slug":"influence-in-east-asia","title":"Influence In East Asia","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/wang-yangming/influence-and-legacy/influence-in-east-asia","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"yangming-in-japan","title":"阳明学在日本","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/wang-yangming/influence-and-legacy/influence-in-east-asia/yangming-in-japan","wordCount":1956,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"modern-reformers","title":"近代的影响","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/wang-yangming/influence-and-legacy/influence-in-east-asia/modern-reformers","wordCount":1691,"readingTime":7}],"introHtml":"<p>本章呈现王阳明心学在东亚与近代的影响。阳明学传入日本，以&quot;知行合一&quot;、崇尚行动的精神，深刻地影响了日本的思想，乃至推动了明治维新（吉田松阴、西乡隆盛等深受其影响）。在近代中国，王阳明的心学又激励人心，影响了梁启超、孙中山等思想家与革命家，成为推动社会变革的精神力量。本章揭示王阳明心学作为跨国思想力量的深远影响。</p>\n"}